  "limitations": [
    "CNN DeComFL accepts only 1\u201332 local images per client in one sequential batch. Larger snapshots and fixture data are refused.",
    "Older CNN functional programs may have a15-image bound despite nominal maxBatch32. This case uses a fresh run and new exports; older staged bundles must be replaced before using this feature.",
    "This is a short USB-powered Debug/Metro qualification with sampled screen asleep and no natural deep Doze. Battery-only survival, endurance, server restart, process death and fresh late join after round one remain unqualified.",
    "The application-level gRPC proxy forwards raw successful payloads and the connection token, drops other metadata/trailers and caps upstream deadlines at60seconds. Failures happen before forwarding, not after ambiguous server acceptance.",
